            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Chris I"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was very easy and very interesting. I would not have thought to put salmon and mushrooms together, but it works well. My husband gave this a 5 and I gave it a 3 so the 4 star rating is an average. My reason for the 3 star is that the flavor is a little too intense. When I make this again I will dilute the oyster sauce, maybe with some stock, to soften the flavor."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lorie Baker"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used fresh portobello mushrooms, lots of minced garlic and substituted a mix of Hoison and Soy Sauce as I had no oyster sauce. I would have never put the mushrooms with Salmon but it works so well that I have made this one of my weekly rotations. Thanks for sharing.",
            "datePublished": "2026-01-24T20:00:24.434Z"
          },
          {
