            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Barb the Bee"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The oyster sauce was so thick I couldn't even pour it out of the bottle, and had to use more wine to thin it enough to even mix with the mushrooms. It ended up masking the flavor of both the salmon and the mushrooms. I won't make this one again.",
